			'donate.termsBody': '&lt;p&gt;By donating, you agree to the terms below.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="dnt-s"&gt;1) Reinvested in the game&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every donation is fully reinvested into the game — servers, development, improvements and events — helping the server stay online.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="dnt-s"&gt;2) Voluntary donation&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Donating is a voluntary act of support for the project. The rewards are a thank-you for helping the server stay online, and everything in the packages can also be earned by playing normally.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="dnt-s"&gt;3) Automatic delivery&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rewards are credited to your account automatically after the donation is confirmed.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="dnt-s"&gt;4) No refunds&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;As these are digital rewards delivered instantly, refunds are NOT possible after delivery.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="dnt-s"&gt;5) Refund exception&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;A refund can only be considered if ALL received rewards are still in the account and available for removal (nothing spent, used, evolved, traded or consumed).&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="dnt-s"&gt;6) Chargeback = ban&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Requesting a chargeback through your bank or card, without going through support, results in a permanent ban from all channels.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="dnt-s"&gt;7) Minors&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you are under 18, only donate with the permission of a parent or guardian.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="dnt-s"&gt;8) Data security&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;We never ask for or store your card data. The donation is processed securely by the provider (Pix / Stripe / InfinitePay).&lt;/p&gt;'
