			'login.termsBody': '&lt;p&gt;By accessing and using Pokémon Story, you agree to the terms below, which are essential to a fair and safe environment for all players.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§1) Accounts&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Only one account is allowed per player.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§2) Conduct and respect&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Offenses, threats, extortion, harassment and any illegal, discriminatory, violent or sexual content are forbidden — including abbreviations, double meanings, images, comments and external links. Disclosing the private data of other players is also forbidden.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§3) Trading accounts, Pokémon and items&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trading is allowed at your own risk; we are not responsible for fraud or scams. Advertising such trades on the official channels (Discord, WhatsApp, etc.) is not allowed.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§4) Bugs and exploits&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Exploiting game flaws (bugs) is forbidden; please report them to the team.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§5) Respect for the team&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Offending the team (Staff) may result in a ban.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§6) Fraud&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Obtaining the passwords of others, stealing or trafficking accounts, and organizing any kind of fraud are forbidden.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§7) Copyright&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Misusing protected images or illustrations, or impersonating others, is forbidden.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§8) Automation&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Using macros, scripts, bots, auto-clickers or any automation results in a permanent ban.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§9) Donations&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Donations support the development of the project and are voluntary, as all paid content can also be earned by playing. Requesting a chargeback results in a permanent ban from all official channels.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§10) Loot boxes&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;The game contains boxes with random rewards, opened with items obtained by playing or donating. Players under 18 must not use them.&lt;/p&gt;'
				+ '&lt;h4 class="sst-s"&gt;§11) Chat&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;The conduct rules in §2 apply to the chat, and advertising other games is also forbidden.&lt;/p&gt;'
